// CodeEditor is Tao Studio's own CodeMirror boundary: a foreign view over the active file's
// revisioned host state. The CodeMirror component itself stays in `packages/ides/studio`, the
// package the client's other views reach the same way; this app-local package is the thin state
// binding between Studio's Tao-owned workbench and that component.
workspace
view CodeEditor() from ./CodeEditor.tsx
